{"unit_id":"siegfly__dsh-deepseek-vision#card-zh","repo":"siegfly/dsh-deepseek-vision","commit":"e44c4c90c96b2c2e85828e96db8c7e9b222b2f67","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-vision 是面向 DSH Web 与 headless 配置的视觉语言网关插件：它注册 DeepSeek + Vision 模型路由，并为网关声明图片输入能力。模型目录支持图片时可直接走原生视觉能力；文本模型收到图片时，插件调用可配置的视觉语言端点生成描述，再将描述交给 DeepSeek。它还提供图片描述缓存、失败占位策略，以及 Web 插件设置卡片来调整端点、模型和图片限制。适合希望继续使用 DeepSeek 文本模型、同时在会话中提交图片的用户。需要 DeepSeek 凭据和视觉语言模型凭据；默认视觉端点为 DashScope，可改用兼容接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:318-358","src/gateway.ts:93-120","src/vl.ts:112-140","src/client/index.ts:95-104"]}
{"unit_id":"siegfly__dsh-deepseek-vision#card-en","repo":"siegfly/dsh-deepseek-vision","commit":"e44c4c90c96b2c2e85828e96db8c7e9b222b2f67","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-deepseek-vision adds image support to DeepSeek in DSH. It passes images to capable models or sends them to a vision service for description before text-only models respond. Configure the endpoint in Web settings. DeepSeek and vision credentials are required; DashScope is the default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:318-358","src/gateway.ts:93-120","src/vl.ts:112-140","src/client/index.ts:95-104"]}
